iption\":\"The contents of some annotation properties are swapped or misused. This pitfall might affect annotation properties related to natural language information (for example, annotations for naming such as rdfs:label or for providing descriptions such as rdfs:comment). Other types of annotation could also be affected as temporal, versioning information, among others.\\t\",\"importance\":\"Minor\",\"num_affected\":8,\"affected_elements\":[\"http://www.example.org/ontology#isDescribedByLineItem\",\"http://www.example.org/ontology#isSimpleElementOf\",\"http://www.example.org/ontology#isAssignedRoleOf\",\"http://www.example.org/ontology#isAssignedOrganizationOf\",\"http://www.example.org/ontology#isLineItemOf\",\"http://www.example.org/ontology#isOrganizationRoleAssignmentOf\",\"http://www.example.org/ontology#isBusinessProcessOf\",\"http://www.example.org/ontology#isCompositeElementOf\"]}]},\"fix_applied\":\"Add rdfs:label and rdfs:comment annotations to all inverse properties flagged by P20 to ensure annotation completeness and correct usage.\"}]}",
